{title: He took my sins away}
{subtitle: Hymnal 261}
{x_theme: joy}
{x_source: docx:1. Incomplete/He took my sins away.docx}

{comment: Chorus}
Song book:
He took my sins away, He took my sins away
And keeps me singing everyday
I’m so glad He took my sins away
He took my sins away
Alternate Chorus:
I’m so glad He took my sins away
He took my sins away, He took my sins away
I’m so glad He took my sins away
He took my sins away

{comment: Verse 1}
I came to Jesus, weary, worn and sad
He took my sins away, He took my sins away
Now His love has made my heart so glad
He took my sins away, He took my sins away

{comment: Verse 2}
The load of sin was more than I could bear
He took my sins away, He took my sins away
Now on Him I roll my every care
He took my sins away, He took my sins away

{comment: Verse 3}
No condemnation have I in my heart
He took my sins away, He took my sins away
His perfect peace He did to me impart
He took my sins away, He took my sins away

{comment: Verse 4}
If you will come to Jesus Christ today
He’ll take your sins away, He’ll take your sins today
An keep you happy in His love each day
He’ll take your sins away, He’ll take your sins today
